    dc:type "resolution-route/empirical-data";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Reanalyze public SETI recordings with prespecified searches for decodable, information-bearing structure beyond standard narrowband and transient detectors. A reproducible signal with non-natural encoding and independent recurrence would support the claim; null searches constrain only the searched encoding classes.";
